/-!
# Observer no-go for the finite exit-capacity constitution

The action, price and administrative views are three different typed
forgetful maps.  The action and administrative maps reuse the exact
occurrence-indexed kernels already generated by the lifecycle and self-U8
iteration.  The price authority map uses the same absolute lifecycle
occurrences and their generated actual-service `K`.  Separately, the two
existing bearer programs retain the same source-backed standing and zero
price observation while one has an exit-capacity renewal and the other is a
fully captured nominal transfer.

The Boolean carrier below is only the bounded two-case readout index for those
two installed program readouts; it supplies no authority.  It is not
installed as an occurrence, root, registry, history or future table.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace ProcessGame
namespace Society
namespace M14SourceGeneratedFiniteExitCapacityObserverNoGo

noncomputable section

